    <!-- Privacy -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_on_device">Typing help runs on this device. This app does not send what you type to any server.</string>
    <string name="privacy_scope">The keyboard can read only the field you are typing in, and only a limited amount of text around the cursor. It cannot read the rest of a conversation, your contacts, your notifications or other apps.</string>
    <string name="privacy_drafts">Drafts are kept in memory only while you type. They are not saved to storage, logs or analytics.</string>
    <string name="privacy_fields">AI help turns itself off in password fields and in fields that ask keyboards not to learn from them.</string>
    <string name="privacy_downloads">Model files are downloaded from Hugging Face only when you tap Download.</string>
    <string name="privacy_license_check">License check: the models come from Desert Ant Labs. Each time a model is loaded, their software contacts Desert Ant\'s server with a random install identifier, this app\'s package name, the model and software version, and the platform. It does not send what you type or any results. The model license requires this check and it cannot be turned off.</string>
    <string name="privacy_caution">Any keyboard handles everything you type with it, including sensitive text. Only use a keyboard you trust.</string>

